sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as model-extractor CLI
    participant HFCol as HuggingFace Collections API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant OCI_RH as registry.redhat.io<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant HFModel as HuggingFace Model API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant HFRaw as HuggingFace README<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant OCI_Q as quay.io<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant GHAPI as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant GHRaw as GitHub Raw Content<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>data/*.yaml

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over CLI,FS: Flow 1: Model Metadata Collection Pipeline (CI/CD)
        CLI->>HFCol: GET /api/collections<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN
        HFCol-->>CLI: Collection index (model references)
        CLI->>OCI_RH: GET /v2/.../manifests<br/>Auth: Registry credentials
        OCI_RH-->>CLI: OCI manifest + modelcard layers
        CLI->>HFModel: GET /api/models/{id}<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN
        HFModel-->>CLI: Model details (license, tasks, etc.)
        CLI->>HFRaw: GET /{repo}/raw/README.md<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN
        HFRaw-->>CLI: README with YAML frontmatter
        CLI->>OCI_Q: GET /v2/.../manifests<br/>Auth: Registry credentials
        OCI_Q-->>CLI: Image architectures & timestamps
        CLI->>GHAPI: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/branches<br/>Auth: Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN
        GHAPI-->>CLI: Branch validation & commit SHAs
        CLI->>GHRaw: GET /{owner}/{repo}/{branch}/agent.yaml<br/>Auth: Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN
        GHRaw-->>CLI: Agent metadata & README content
        CLI->>FS: Write models-catalog.yaml,<br/>mcp-servers-catalog.yaml,<br/>agents-catalog.yaml
    end

    participant Konflux as Konflux Pipeline
    participant Git as Git Repository<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant QuayPush as quay.io<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Konflux,QuayPush: Flow 2: Container Image Build (Konflux)
        Konflux->>Git: Clone repository<br/>Auth: Git credentials
        Git-->>Konflux: Source + data/*.yaml
        Note over Konflux: docker build -f Dockerfile.konflux<br/>(copies data/*.yaml into UBI9-minimal)
        Konflux->>QuayPush: Push multi-arch image<br/>Auth: Registry push credentials
    end

    participant InitContainer as Init Container<br/>(odh-model-metadata-collection)
    participant Volume as Pod Volume Mount<br/>/app/data
    participant Dashboard as RHOAI Dashboard

    rect rgb(224, 255, 224)
        Note over InitContainer,Dashboard: Flow 3: Catalog Data Consumption (Runtime)
        InitContainer->>Volume: Copy data/*.yaml<br/>to shared volume
        Dashboard->>Volume: Read models-catalog.yaml,<br/>mcp-servers-catalog.yaml,<br/>agents-catalog.yaml
    end
